  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h2 class=\"font-claude-response-heading text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5\"><strong>Bosho Coffee Affiliate Program</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://www.boshocoffee.com/_next/image?url=https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0928/5451/8077/files/Variety_Pack_Main.webp?v=1764541952&w=3840&q=75\" style=\"width:300px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.shopify.com%2Fs%2Ffiles%2F1%2F0928%2F5451%2F8077%2Ffiles%2FVariety_Pack_Main.webp%3Fv%3D1764541952&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></strong><br></p><h3 class=\"font-claude-response-subheading text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5\"><strong>About Our Brand and Products:</strong></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Bosho Coffee is a premium African coffee brand honoring the legacy of Black cowboys who brewed powerful coffee on the frontier. We source single-origin beans from Ethiopia, Kenya, and Burundi and roast them using traditional methods delivering bold flavor and character. We offer Light (Daybreak), Medium (Iron Horse), and Dark (Gold) roasts, plus a Variety Pack. </p><hr class=\"border-border-300 my-4\"><h3 class=\"font-claude-response-subheading text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5\"><strong>What Makes Us Different:</strong></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">✅ <strong>Unique heritage story</strong> - Only brand celebrating Black cowboys. Black Owned Business!<br>✅ <strong>African single-origin excellence</strong> - Premium Ethiopian, Kenyan, and Burndian Beans<br>✅ <strong>Bold visual identity</strong> - Western aesthetic that pops on social media<br>✅ <strong>Ethical &amp; transparent</strong> - Supporting small-scale African farmers<br>✅ <strong>New brand energy</strong></p><hr class=\"border-border-300 my-4\"><h3 class=\"font-claude-response-subheading text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5\"><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn:</strong></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">💰 12% commission on all sales<br>💰 Higher commissions on variety packs ($54.99)<br>💰 Comissions on <strong>Subscriptions </strong>for recurring<strong> </strong><strong>passive income!</strong></p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Example:</strong> Get 50 people to subscribe to 2 bags of coffee =&gt; $240 / month of passive income!</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Bonuses:</strong> Performance incentives, exclusive discount codes, early product access, featured affiliate spotlights</p><hr class=\"border-border-300 my-4\"><h3 class=\"font-claude-response-subheading text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5\"><strong>How to Promote Us:</strong></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Top Converting Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc space-y-2.5 pl-7\"><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Social media</strong>: Unboxing videos, morning routines, heritage storytelling, lifestyle posts</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Blogs/SEO</strong>: \"Best African Coffee,\" ethical brand roundups, brewing guides</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Email</strong>: Grand Opening announcements, gift guides, personal recommendations</li><li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\"><strong>Video</strong>: Product reviews, taste tests, brand story content</li></ul><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Best Audiences:</strong> Coffee enthusiasts, conscious consumers, heritage/history fans, Western culture lovers, supporters of Black-owned businesses, gift buyers</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>We Provide:</strong> Product photos, lifestyle images, social captions, exclusive discount codes, seasonal materials</p><hr class=\"border-border-300 my-4\"><h3 class=\"font-claude-response-subheading text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5\"><strong>Why Join Now:</strong></h3><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">✨ Grand Opening momentum<br>✨ Get in early as a founding affiliate<br>✨ Year-round demand (coffee is daily essential)<br>✨ Gift-friendly for holidays &amp; special occasions<br>✨ Dedicated support + affiliate community<br>✨ Quick approval (24-48 hours)</p></div></div>",
